on for creating MP4/H264 videos fully client-side in the browser, without running into H264 patent issues. \n\n---\n\nDocs are WIP.\n\n## License\n\nMIT, see [LICENSE.md](http://github.com/mattdesl/mp4-wasm/blob/master/LICENSE.md) for details.\n","readmeFilename":"README.md"}